Remaining: pure regalloc — target loads field_0x38 into r4 then field_0x3C into r1 and keeps r1 in r1 for the stores; mine spills to r2. Tried declaring field_0x74 as s8 (no change). Nothing moved off 965.

Best 205/33 insns (93.7%). Working C:
